Thank you for applying to join {org}. Your application reference is {reference}. The committee will review it and contact you with the outcome.

Kind regards,
{org}`,sms_body:`{org}: application {reference} received.`,enabled:!0},{key:`membership_approved`,label:`Membership approved`,subject:`Your {org} membership is approved`,email_body:`Hello {name},

Your membership has been approved. Your membership number is {member_number} and your payout position in the rotation is {position}.

Log in to your dashboard to see your contribution schedule.

Kind regards,
{org}`,sms_body:`{org}: membership approved, no. {member_number}.`,enabled:!0},{key:`membership_rejected`,label:`Application declined`,subject:`Update on your {org} application`,email_body:`Hello {name},

After review, the committee could not approve your application at this time.

Reason: {reason}

You are welcome to contact the committee for more information.

Kind regards,
{org}`,sms_body:`{org}: application outcome recorded.`,enabled:!0},{key:`payment_confirmed`,label:`Contribution confirmed`,subject:`Contribution confirmed for {period}`,email_body:`Hello {name},

Your contribution of {amount} for {period} has been verified and recorded. Reference: {reference}.

Kind regards,
{org}`,sms_body:`{org}: {period} contribution confirmed.`,enabled:!0},{key:`payment_failed`,label:`Payment could not be confirmed`,subject:`We could not confirm your {period} payment`,email_body:`Hello {name},

We could not confirm the payment declared for {period} (reference {reference}).

Please check your payment details or contact the committee.

Kind regards,
{org}`,sms_body:`{org}: payment for {period} not confirmed.`,enabled:!0},{key:`contribution_reminder`,label:`Contribution due reminder`,subject:`Your {period} contribution is due on {due_date}`,email_body:`Hello {name},

Your contribution of {amount} for {period} is due on {due_date}.

Use reference {reference} when you pay.

Kind regards,
{org}`,sms_body:`{org}: {period} contribution due {due_date}.`,enabled:!0},{key:`contribution_overdue`,label:`Contribution overdue`,subject:`Your {period} contribution is overdue`,email_body:`Hello {name},

