Kind regards,
{org}`,sms_body:`{org}: payout {amount} processed.`,enabled:!0}],Av={privacy:`DRAFT FOR COMMITTEE REVIEW — How we handle personal information.

Masakhe Stokvel collects only the information needed to manage your membership: your name and contact details, identity details where the constitution requires them, and your contribution records. We do not sell personal information and we do not store card numbers or security codes.

Members can view and correct their own contact details at any time, and can ask the committee for a copy of the information held about them. Access to member records is limited to the committee members who need it to run the stokvel.

Before launch, the committee must review this notice against POPIA and the stokvel constitution, complete the gaps marked in brackets, and record the legal name and registration details of the organisation.`,terms:`DRAFT FOR COMMITTEE REVIEW — Terms of use.

By using this website and member portal you agree to use it honestly and to keep your login details private. You are responsible for the accuracy of the information you submit.

Access to the member portal is limited to approved members. The committee may suspend or end access where the stokvel rules are breached.

The committee must review these terms, add the stokvel’s official name, the dispute-resolution process, and the governing law clause before launch.`,rules:`DRAFT FOR COMMITTEE REVIEW — Stokvel rules and terms.

1. Membership is open to persons approved by the committee.
2. Contributions are payable monthly on or before the agreed due day.
3. A contribution is recorded only once the committee has verified the payment.
4. The payout rotation is set by the committee in the order members are approved, and is published in the member dashboard.
5. A member whose contributions are outstanding may not receive a payout until the account is in good standing.
6. Corrections to financial records are made by documented adjustment, never by deleting history.
7. Members must keep their contact details up to date.

The committee must complete the contribution amount, the fee structure, the penalty rules and the payout rules to match the approved constitution.`,retention:`DRAFT FOR COMMITTEE REVIEW — Data retention.

Contribution and payout records are kept for as long as the stokvel is operating and afterwards for the period required by law. Contact details of declined applicants are kept for [period] and then removed.

Contact enquiries are kept for [period]. Audit logs are kept for [period].

The committee must confirm these periods and note who is responsible for deletion.`},jv={org_name:`Masakhe Stokvel`,org_tagline:`Save Today… Build Tomorrow!`,motto:`More People, More Support, More Growth`,logo_url:``,brand_graphic_url:``,contact_email:``,contact_phone:``,contact_whatsapp:``,meeting_venue:``,business_hours:``,social_facebook:``,social_instagram:``,social_whatsapp:``,social_x:``,bank_name:``,account_name:``,account_number:``,branch_code:``,payment_instructions:``,contribution_amount:0,contribution_frequency:`monthly`,contribution_due_day:7,membership_fee:0,membership_open:!0,require_approval:!0,publish_stats:!1,rotation_months:12,payment_provider:`none`,payment_mode:`sandbox`,payment_setup_notes:``,sms_enabled:!1,sms_provider:``,notification_templates:kv,legal:Av,seo:{default_title:`Masakhe Stokvel — Save Today. Build Tomorrow.`,default_description:`A member-owned stokvel with monthly contributions, verified records and a published rotating payout schedule.`,og_image_url:``},nav_items:[{label:`Home`,path:`/`,visible:!0,order:1},{label:`How It Works`,path:`/how-it-works`,visible:!0,order:3},{label:`Membership`,path:`/membership`,visible:!0,order:4}],committee:[]};async function Mv(){let e=await Ov(X.entities.SiteSettings,{},{sort:`-created_date`});return e?{...jv,...e,legal:{...Av,...e.legal??{}},seo:{...jv.seo,...e.seo??{}},notification_templates:(e.notification_templates??[]).length>0?e.notification_templates:kv}:jv}function Nv(e,t){return(e?.notification_templates??kv).find(e=>e.key===t)??kv.find(e=>e.key===t)??null}function Pv(e,t={}){return e?String(e).replace(/\{(\w+)\}/g,(e,n)=>t[n]!==void 0&&t[n]!==null?String(t[n]):``):``}function Fv(e,t,n={}){let r=Nv(e,t);return{enabled:r?.enabled!==!1,subject:Pv(r?.subject??``,n),body:Pv(r?.email_body??``,n),smsBody:Pv(r?.sms_body??``,n)}}function Iv(e,t=`ZAR`){return new Intl.NumberFormat(`en-ZA`,{style:`currency`,currency:t,minimumFractionDigits:2}).format(Number(e||0))}function Lv(e){return{monthly:`Mont