2. The committee reviews the application. Once approved you receive a membership number and a position in the payout rotation.

3. Pay your monthly contribution using the reference issued to you. Your dashboard shows what is due, what has been verified and what is still outstanding.`},benefits:{title:`What you get as a member`,body:`A private dashboard showing only your own records.
A statement you can generate for any period and download as a PDF.
A transaction export you can share with anyone who needs proof of payment.`},payouts:{title:`How payouts are made`,body:`Contributions are pooled each month. The member whose turn it is in the rotation receives the pooled payout, and the payment is posted to their statement with a reference.

